      "description": "Capture and single-button export actions.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\">Choose a button</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font:550 14px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;display:inline-flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;border-radius:7px;padding:11px 17px;min-height:42px;transition:background .16s ease-out;text-align:left;border:0;background:var(--forest,#004225);color:#f0faf4}.ds-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--forest-hover,#075a35)}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#8bc7a5);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-primary:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary{transition:none}}"
    },
