    "overview": "Button Copy uses a dark, forest-tinted interface around locally captured website buttons. The library gives each capture an interactive preview with its original appearance, followed by its name, website, state count, and capture notes. The interface's own controls use forest green.\n\nThe fixed collection rail, preview grid, and right-hand detail panel keep filters, bulk actions, inspection, and code export distinct. Borders and background changes define these regions. Small system text carries metadata; the captured button is the main visual content.",
